Hi Craig, hi listfolk,

The grid_plot_obj function was only really written for the Mexico
dolphin example data and wasn't really meant for general use, so I'm not
super-surprised that it doesn't work. I've never tried it when there's
more than one polygon in the data, so that might also be an issue. Might
be easier to "roll your own" code for this more complicated case.

cheers,
--dave

